      "writtenOn": "2025-09-11T19:42:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I captured the diff between 1.stg and 2.stg as described above; its a 4.4M file. Here is the drive link:\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1KY_wQRYuAcGaYuRPOH2EBkYPAP_sbtc_/view?usp\u003ddrive_link\n\n\n\u003e If old Rust code in vendor module will not be upset by the type change, we\u0027re fine. But there is a type change!\n\nHow do we verify this, given the new variable was added to a hole in the C structure which shouldn\u0027t be impacting the ABI.",
      "parentUuid": "90daeb32_acff700a",
